Package: ground0
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Irak4t0n <Irak4t0n@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Pre-Depends: dpkg (>= 1.19)
Depends: applaunch, python3, curl, sudo, systemd
Recommends: cz-desk-mode, network-manager, iputils-ping, util-linux
Homepage: https://github.com/Irak4t0n/Ground0
Description: Ground0 home screen for the M5Stack Cardputer Zero
 A replacement home screen for the Cardputer Zero launcher: app list and icon
 grid, type-to-search with commands, favourites, recents and store categories,
 per-app updates through 0Hero, 24 themes, a LoRa radio switch for MeshZero,
 and a quick panel for the HDMI desktop, lean boot and Wi-Fi.
 .
 The stock launcher is kept beside it. "ground0 off" switches back, and
 removing this package restores the stock launcher.
